edictable fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811440/extras/874f80e0c823628fb583beb2dca1b759.avif?t=1772404281\" width=700 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RTS WITH A SMILE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you miss lighthearted RTS chaos with real strategy, destructible worlds, dynamic weather, and silly economy twists, Atom Assault delivers. Inspired by the energy of 8-Bit Armies, Command and Conquer, Red Alert, Company of Heroes, KKND, and the legendary Z.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811440/extras/cde739e008248d750ef8e798b3018d47.avif?t=1772404281\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CALL TO ARMS<br>Play the demo, wishlist Atom Assault, and jump into the discussions to share your wildest feature ideas with Papa Mike, the indie developer making all this chaos happen.</p>","developers":["GameEraStudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811440/577b74b305a1e9fb9c697dbfa05853deb1d296b5/header.jpg?t=1772404281","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2811440/1719999238/a3daa07c1ded78649526f17f16547b83abea2954/1771685041/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771685379","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam